 "_provenance": {
  "what": "max |C_l / C_l^CLASS - 1| per l band of the pre-#54 code (TE and lensed TE: |dTE| / sqrt(TT EE) of the reference), against reference_data/<name>/{cls,cl_pp,cls_lensed}.npz. tests/test_cl_vs_class.py passes a band if fix error <= base error + 1e-4 or the spectrum moved by at most 1e-4 of the base spectrum; bands starting at l >= 30 are checked l by l on the base spectra of spectra_npz (every l must pass), the 2-30 bands on these band maxima (docs/adr/0005-cl-differentiability.md, Decision 8)",
  "base_commit": "5ac3df31f273fac751c40f873f0b080599cbbfb1",
  "base_tree": "git archive 5ac3df3 (upstream/main before #58/#60/#61; the branch's base)",
